Dear Dylan,
The use of out of band intensities for background correction is described in 
detail in this paper: http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/23476028.

Signal intensity is measured from type I green probes in the red channel & 
type I red probes in the green channel as an alternative method of deriving 
the background signal from the array.

I hope this helps answer your question.

